    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 46da2344c27643aabc27ae2a488ba724
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'An area-denial bloom (spore pod, puffball, gas mine — any faction): stationary or slow. Shot at, or with anything within 6 m, it bursts its signature (EnemyData › Kit › Signature: a Cloud Burst — a cloud that hides its kin and poisons whoever stands in it) and regrows it on cooldown; strikes in reach. Give its data low or zero speed.'
